    title: 'Sports2D: Compute 2D human pose and angles from a video or a webcam'
    authors:
      - family-names: Pagnon
        given-names: David
    journal: Journal of Open Source Software
    year: 2024
    doi: 10.21105/joss.06849
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Are the kinematic and kinetic patterns of the lower limbs during gait different between adults and older adults?
    authors:
